Package: biblio
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Citation Libraries and Text Analytics on Abstracts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mario", "Martinez", email = "mario.a.martinez@live.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Description: Converts RefWorks and RIS exports, and saved Google Scholar results
    pages, to BibTeX, and reads BibTeX into data frames and Excel files. Looks up
    missing abstracts in OpenAlex. Runs text analytics on abstracts: topic modeling
    (LDA), cosine document similarity, and trends over time. Heavy computation is
    implemented in C++ via Rcpp.
URL: https://github.com/cownr10r/biblio
BugReports: https://github.com/cownr10r/biblio/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: Rcpp, writexl, ggplot2, xml2, jsonlite, curl
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: readxl, testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
